# Spec Template

Filename pattern:

```text
YYYY-MM-DD-<short-feature-name>-<session-slug>.md
```

`<session-slug>` is your session's branch or worktree name (e.g. `charming-hoover-c0a3c9`); appending it makes the filename unique by construction, so no name check is needed even when sessions run in parallel on the same day (see `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_WORKFLOW.md` §3.2). Commit the spec immediately once it lands and is accepted.

